 People here can be ... particular about their specialness in relation with the rest of North America(and i mean that in a good way.)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> My memory is an Aberrant blows up in the Midwestern united states and basically destroys the majority of farms and the capacity to farm there ever. So because the US has the largest military on the planet they invade and conquer Canada and Mexico.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-11T23:22:23-08:00","id":1185033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1183314-sell-me-on-aeon-as-a-sci-fi-setting?p=1184901#post1184901\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> inde<br /> <br /> Nice, i just came back home and i'm gonna look into that in the evening.<br /> So far most of my fear (or rather uncertainties) about the setting have been laid to rest.<br /> <br /> The only thing left really is i'm curious about the state of Qu\u00e9bec (and the rest of Canada) in the future of Aeon. Everybody likes knowing how their home is in sci-fi settings.<br /> I know the USA are basically a fascist federation (i only read the wiki and the TVTropes page so my knowledge is minimal) and i'm curious how Quebec would react to that. Most sci-fi setting have Qu\u00e9bec be independent (Rift and Shadowrun comes to mind). I don't think it would be impossible for future Qu\u00e9bec to be a fascist state, but i don't see it being part of a fascist regime without alot of complications. People here can be ... particular about their specialness in relation with the rest of North America(and i mean that in a good way.)</div> </div> </div> </div>As of the original edition Qu\u00e9bec is <i>nominally</i> an independent sovereign nation after the FSA conquered Canada, emphasis on the nominally. The FSA has license to move troops through and maintain permenant installations, and the Qu\u00e9becois find themselves on a very short leash. Both the FSA and Qu\u00e9becois feel they're little different from any other FSA district, which the Qu\u00e9becois are not happy in the least about, but they're not able to do much in the face of the FSM military.<br /> <br /> For the new edition, we find out Tuesday.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T00:39:02-08:00","id":1185047,"title":"","content":"It really bothers me how much less preposterous I find the FSA today than I did in 2000 or so... I miss finding it preposterous....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-12T00:46:51-08:00","id":1185048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1183314-sell-me-on-aeon-as-a-sci-fi-setting?p=1184940#post1184940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> My memory is an Aberrant blows up in the Midwestern united states and basically destroys the majority of farms and the capacity to farm there ever. So because the US has the largest military on the planet they invade and conquer Canada and Mexico.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not largest. Most expensive. The US\u2019s military\u2019s unparalleled global advantage is one of technological mass production, not numbers of soldiers. China easily has it beat in that regard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}